{"lines": ["Two federal agents watched a black triangle rise over a ridge, and it made no sound at all.", "Twenty twenty-six. A guarded hilltop post, eight twenty-three p.m. A third agent's thermal scope called it in.", "It climbed straight up for ten seconds. No tilt. No wobble. No lights.", "Then it stopped dead, and hung there for twenty seconds.", "But on that hilltop, they said, even a small drone a mile away would be loud.", "From a dead stop, it shot sideways, fast as a fighter jet, banked, and dove into a canyon.", "So fast it left the thermal scope's view. Still, total silence.", "Next morning, they searched the canyon. No wreckage. No scarred ground. Not one damaged plant.", "And the agents' own FBI statement says it lasted three seconds. The Pentagon's record: over thirty. So who's right, the Pentagon, or the two federal agents?"], "words": [["Two", 0.0, 0.1], ["federal", 0.1, 0.46], ["agents", 0.46, 0.88], ["watched", 0.88, 1.6], ["a", 1.6, 1.84], ["black", 1.84, 2.02], ["triangle", 2.02, 2.34], ["rise", 2.34, 3.04], ["over", 3.04, 3.5], ["a", 3.5, 3.62], ["ridge,", 3.62, 3.96], ["and", 4.22, 4.38], ["it", 4.38, 4.46], ["made", 4.46, 4.58], ["no", 4.58, 4.88], ["sound", 4.88, 5.22], ["at", 5.22, 5.46], ["all.", 5.46, 5.66], ["Twenty", 6.02, 6.244], ["twenty-six.", 6.244, 6.58], ["A", 6.94, 7.2], ["guarded", 7.2, 7.5], ["hilltop", 7.5, 7.98], ["post,", 7.98, 8.36], ["eight", 8.36, 8.921], ["twenty-three", 8.921, 10.156], ["p.m.", 10.156, 10.38], ["A", 10.74, 10.94], ["third", 10.94, 11.14], ["agent's", 11.14, 11.88], ["thermal", 11.88, 12.04], ["scope", 12.04, 12.48], ["called", 12.48, 12.88], ["it", 12.88, 13.08], ["in.", 13.08, 13.28], ["It", 13.64, 13.688], ["climbed", 13.688, 13.928], ["straight", 13.928, 14.288], ["up", 14.288, 14.528], ["for", 14.528, 14.728], ["ten", 14.728, 14.968], ["seconds.", 14.968, 15.328], ["No", 15.688, 15.948], ["tilt.", 15.948, 16.148], ["No", 16.508, 16.688], ["wobble.", 16.688, 17.188], ["No", 17.368, 17.488], ["lights.